@startuml
title Job 域用例图
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor 求职者 as User
actor 调度器 as Scheduler
actor "FreeHire API" as FreeHire
actor "JobSpy 站点" as JobSpy
actor "Profile 域" as Profile
actor "Action 域" as Action

rectangle "Job Helper / Job" {
  usecase "UC-JOB-001\n同步职位源" as UC1
  usecase "UC-JOB-002\n快速保存公开 URL" as UC2
  usecase "UC-JOB-003\n标准化、去重、\nGate 与 Rank" as UC3
  usecase "UC-JOB-004\n查看和筛选 Inbox" as UC4
  usecase "UC-JOB-005\n作出或覆盖职位决定" as UC5
  usecase "UC-JOB-006\n处理可能重复职位" as UC6
  usecase "UC-JOB-007\n刷新有效性并归档" as UC7
  usecase "UC-JOB-008\n查看来源运行诊断" as UC8
  usecase "UC-JOB-009\n手动重跑来源" as UC9
  usecase "记录 SourceRun\n与错误诊断" as Diagnostics
  usecase "保存规则证据" as Evidence
}

Scheduler --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC4
User --> UC5
User --> UC6
Scheduler --> UC7
User --> UC7
User --> UC8
User --> UC9

FreeHire --> UC1
JobSpy --> UC1
Profile --> UC3
UC1 ..> UC3 : <<include>>
UC1 ..> Diagnostics : <<include>>
UC9 ..> UC1 : <<include>>
UC3 ..> Evidence : <<include>>
UC5 ..> Action : 发布变化
UC7 ..> Action : 发布变化

note right of UC1
  FreeHire 为主源；
  JobSpy 全部受支持站点默认启用；
  搜索词默认来自 Profile TargetRole。
  403/captcha 等只形成诊断。
end note

note bottom of UC3
  标准化/硬去重先于 Gate；
  Rank 五因素投票聚合 tier；
  语言对照 LanguageProficiency。
end note

note bottom of UC5
  系统只推荐；
  Shortlist/Applied 仅由用户决定。
end note
@enduml
